Source: cygnet-provider
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Sanctum SecOps LLC <support@sanctumsecops.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake, ninja-build, libssl-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/sanctumsecopsmssp/cygnet-provider

Package: cygnet-provider
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, openssl (>= 3.0)
Description: OpenSSL 3 provider for Sanctum SecOps PKI
 Supplies the CYGNET-HMAC, CYGNET-CMAC, CYGNET-KMAC-128, and CYGNET-KMAC-256
 MAC algorithms, which delegate to the FIPS provider where one is available,
 plus provider dispatch, capability discovery, and algorithm registration
 points for use with Sanctum SecOps / Cygnus PKI infrastructure.
 .
 The module is installed to /usr/lib/<triplet>/ossl-modules/cygnetprov.so.
 Point OPENSSL_MODULES at that directory, or reference it from openssl.cnf,
 to load the provider.
